# GitOps Tools

GitOps configs for managed Kubernetes tools (e.g. Harbor) on `nprd-apps` / `managed-tools`.

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Legacy `.cursorrules` remains for other editors.

## Key paths

- `<tool>/base/` — generic manifests
- `<tool>/overlays/<cluster>/` — cluster-specific overlays

## Conventions

- Kustomize base + overlays; declarative GitOps only
- Always set requests/limits and useful labels (`app`, `managed-by`)
- Never commit secrets; use external secret management
